OL,3,GNEWSAConfusion as council changes in
OL,4,AThames Valley delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanned changes to the way that
OL,7,FOxfordshire and West Berkshire are
OL,8,Fgoverned have been delayed.
OL,10,FThe government had previously announced
OL,11,Fthe area would be split into three new
OL,12,Funitary authorities - one to the north,
OL,13,Fone to the south including west
OL,14,FBerkshire, and a Greater Oxford
OL,15,Fauthority for the city and its
OL,16,Fgreenbelt.
OL,18,FBut Secretary of State for Housing,
OL,19,FCommunities and Local Government Angela
OL,20,FRayner has announced a pause until the
OL,21,Fdecision is "reviewed".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
