OL,3,GNEWSAConfusion as council changes in
OL,4,AThames Valley delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeff Brooks, leader of West Berkshire
OL,7,FCouncil, said the process had already
OL,8,Fcost the authority "tens and tens and
OL,9,Ftens of thousands of pounds" and has
OL,10,Furged the government to "get over the
OL,11,Fissue" and "crack on with this good
OL,12,Fsolution".
